<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9910"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ozdude<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ozdude<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 10:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This guy has been plastered all over KAKE and only talking to them. It&#39;s almost getting to the point KAKE is exploiting him. This poor guy is very emotional. He can hardly speak he gets so upset and last night they took him to his former home where his mother was murdered. It was sad. I wish him well and pray for him, too.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
