<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10210"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Haytrader<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Haytrader<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 6:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Wish I would have thought of somthing like this. <BR>Winkety wink. <BR>I really would like to see the celebs get involved with the living victems here. <BR>Instead of the back patting news conferences and parades around the old house, how about some genuine phycological help for Relsford, the Oteros, and other victems. The Relsford son doesn&#39;t even appear to know he is being used for &#34;exclusive&#34; only exploitation. <BR>Dr. Phil and O, among others, have the where with all to genuinally help these guys. And writing them, sending E-mail, or just posting support here, all should help to secure that help. Also, spreading the word to other boards, sending this request to your personal E-mail friends, and verbally spreading the word, will surely help to get the word out. <BR>And just helping &#34;get this done&#34; will make ya feel better.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10210-->
<!--Post: 10227--><!--Time: 1109828385-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10227"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stormy74<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stormy74<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 9:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Alright, I have done it. I emailed both Oprah and Dr. Phil. I will be spreading the word to others who would like to see these victims families get some help. I think the overwhelming amount of emails will start to generate that. I will be trying to call both shows over the next couple of days. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10227-->
