</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you and God Bless all of you, you are truly great and caring people, I will pray that we get help for them E. if you go to the Possible vic, page and look at don&#39;t forget CC you will see how you have impacted my life by caring so much about these people Thanks E.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
